<title>UK: UK's Norcros to repurchase 5.0 pct stock.</title>
<headline>UK's Norcros to repurchase 5.0 pct stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British ceramic tiles manufacturer Norcros Plc said on Thursday it planned to repurchase up to 8.74 million shares representing about five percent of its share capital.</p>
<p>The company said it would purchase shares from brokers Kleinwort Benson Securities which will purchase shares from the market.</p>
<p>The company intends to make such purchases during the next year as and when market conditions were favourable.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
